From 58c7e9a05511d06965f1a3534aed4c1c01126f6a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: GrgaPalcic <26028466+GrgaPalcic@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 10:30:55 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] glm cuda: TF_KV_SHARE beside TF_GLM_KV_SHARD

The store takes a sharded pool's parts as its pages, reclaim runs per part with a leaf filter, a resume opens in its adopted pages' part, and a sharded kept state's slot leaves the pages' latent rows on the pages (the slot was 5.8 GiB without that, one kept state in 7 GiB; with it about 252 MiB, 27 states).
